    <!-- Twin of elevation_map_publisher scenario:=slanted_pads (no reference file). Map
         19 x 6 m from (-2, -3). Two 2.0 m platforms: start x -1.5 to 1.0, y -2 to 2 (the
         robot spawns at (0, 0); launch with -z 3.4) and goal x 15.1 to 16.6, y -1.5 to 1.5,
         goal (15.85, 0). Between them seven 1 x 1 m sloped pads, tops within 2.0 +- 0.2 m,
         in two columns facing each other; consecutive pads 1.9 m apart in x so the plan
         zigzags. The rest is ground at 0. Each pad is a 0.05 m slab tilted so its top face
         is the map's plane, on 5 vertical support strips. Generated from the table:
           L1  x   1.8 to 2.8   y  0.3 to 1.3  mid z 2.00, 15 deg, low toward y 0
           R1  x   3.7 to 4.7   y -1.3 to -0.3 mid z 2.05, 12 deg, low toward y 0
           L2  x   5.6 to 6.6   y  0.3 to 1.3  mid z 1.98, 18 deg, low toward y 0
           R2  x   7.5 to 8.5   y -1.3 to -0.3 mid z 2.00, 20 deg, low toward y 0
           L3  x   9.4 to 10.4  y  0.3 to 1.3  mid z 2.03, 14 deg, low toward y 0
           R3  x  11.3 to 12.3  y -1.3 to -0.3 mid z 1.97, 16 deg, low toward y 0
           C   x  13.2 to 14.2  y -0.5 to 0.5  mid z 2.00, 15 deg, low toward -x -->
